      "side": 1,
      "message": "I changed the \u0027false\u0027 in the following line of code to \u0027true\u0027 in my macbook, \"https://skia.googlesource.com/skia/+/44e33b331d6c0411063969bc19befe51119a0b14/tests/FontMgrTest.cpp#152\". Without the patch, an error will be reported:\n```\nFailures:\n\t../../tests/FontMgrTest.cpp:156\tAvenir Next [600 5 1] !\u003d Avenir Next [700 5 1] [FontMgr_Iter]: s1 \u003d\u003d s2\n\t../../tests/FontMgrTest.cpp:156\tBaskerville [600 5 1] !\u003d Baskerville [700 5 1] [FontMgr_Iter]: s1 \u003d\u003d s2\n``` \nBut with the patch can pass the test.\n\nHere are the values ​​of kCTFontSlantTrait for the relevant fonts：\n```\nAvenirNext-Italic slant : 0.050000\nAvenirNext-UltraLightItalic slant : 0.050000\nAvenirNext-MediumItalic slant : 0.050000\nAvenirNext-DemiBoldItalic slant : 0.050000\nAvenirNext-BoldItalic slant : 0.055556\nAvenirNext-HeavyItalic slant : 0.055556\nAvenirNextCondensed-Italic slant : 0.055556\nAvenirNextCondensed-UltraLightItalic slant : 0.055556\nAvenirNextCondensed-MediumItalic slant : 0.055556\nAvenirNextCondensed-DemiBoldItalic slant : 0.055556\nAvenirNextCondensed-BoldItalic slant : 0.055556\nAvenirNextCondensed-HeavyItalic slant : 0.050000\nBaskerville-Italic slant : 0.094444\nBaskerville-SemiBoldItalic slant : 0.088889\nBaskerville-BoldItalic slant : 0.094444\n```\n\nOn my macbook, the slant value of all italic fonts ranges from 0.016 to 0.16.",
